From c33c9933b4141be6568c23e25e4bf893342fb6e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZeromusXYZ <zeromus.xyz@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Aug 2024 20:46:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [Game] GM script normalization (#1072)

- Changed most of the GM scripts output to use a standardized format (for V1 commands)
- Changed Faction Id from ``uint`` to ``FactionsEnum``
- Code cleaning on GM commands
- Removed obsolete chat functions
- Removed ``BroadcastPacketToFaction`` and ``BroadcastPacketToZone`` functions
- Removed ``/dummy`` and added a dummy option to use ``/spawn npc dummy`` instead
- Added debug area to ``/teleport``
